<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Heuristic for Determining <math id="A1.SS1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In our experiments, we use the following heuristic for finding <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>: first, the best distortion <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{\text{max}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{\text{max}}</annotation></semantics></math> is determined, which the respective model achieves when trained via (classical) amortised variational inference; then the baseline for the desired reconstruction quality is defined as <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{0}=0.9\,\mathcal{D}_{\text{max}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>0.9</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{0}=0.9\,\mathcal{D}_{\text{max}}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Experimental support for this heuristic can be found in App. <a href="#A1.SS7.SSS1" title="A.7.1 Demonstrating the CO Framework on the Example of DKS ‣ A.7 Supplementary Experimental Results ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.7.1</span></a> (Fig. <a href="#A1.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ A.7.1 Demonstrating the CO Framework on the Example of DKS ‣ A.7 Supplementary Experimental Results ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>).</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Learning the Initial Distribution</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The VHP defines a (VAE-like) lower bound on the optimal empirical Bayes prior <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p^{\ast}(\mathbf{z}_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p^{\ast}(\mathbf{z}_{1})</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx19" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p^{\ast}(\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\Big[\log p_{\psi_{0}}(\mathbf{z}_{1})\Big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p^{\ast}(\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\Big[\log p_{\psi_{0}}(\mathbf{z}_{1})\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p_{\mathcal{D}}(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{u})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x},\mathbf{u})}}\Big[\log p_{\psi_{0}}(\mathbf{z}_{1})\Big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p_{\mathcal{D}}(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{u})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x},\mathbf{u})}}\Big[\log p_{\psi_{0}}(\mathbf{z}_{1})\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p_{\mathcal{D}}(\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Big[\log p_{\psi_{0}}(\mathbf{z}_{1})\Big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p_{\mathcal{D}}(\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Big[\log p_{\psi_{0}}(\mathbf{z}_{1})\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E21"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E21.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\geq\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p_{\mathcal{D}}(\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\!\bigg[\!\underbrace{\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\!\bigg[\!\log\frac{p_{\psi_{0}}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\,p(\bm{\zeta})}{q_{\phi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}\bigg]}_{=\,\mathcal{F}_{\text{VHP}}(\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\mathbf{z}_{1})}\!\bigg]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo rspace="0.448em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mtext>VHP</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p_{\mathcal{D}}(\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\!\bigg[\!\underbrace{\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\!\bigg[\!\log\frac{p_{\psi_{0}}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\,p(\bm{\zeta})}{q_{\phi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}\bigg]}_{=\,\mathcal{F}_{\text{VHP}}(\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\mathbf{z}_{1})}\!\bigg],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">which introduces an upper bound on the rate:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E22"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{R}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{R}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E22.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\left[\log q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})-\log p_{\psi_{0}}(\mathbf{z}_{1})-\sum^{T}_{t=2}\log p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\left[\log q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})-\log p_{\psi_{0}}(\mathbf{z}_{1})-\sum^{T}_{t=2}\log p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E23"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E23.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\left[\log q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})-\mathcal{F}_{\text{VHP}}(\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\mathbf{z}_{1})-\sum^{T}_{t=2}\log p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mtext>VHP</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\left[\log q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})-\mathcal{F}_{\text{VHP}}(\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\mathbf{z}_{1})-\sum^{T}_{t=2}\log p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(23)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex4"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathcal{R}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathcal{R}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Note that
<span id="A1.SS2.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text"><math id="A1.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0})\mathrel{\widehat{=}}\mathcal{R}(\psi,\phi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mover accent="true"><mo>=</mo><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0})\mathrel{\widehat{=}}\mathcal{R}(\psi,\phi)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, where <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\psi_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the now learnable parameters of the prior.
Hence, Eq. (<a href="#A1.E23" title="In A.2 Learning the Initial Distribution ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23</span></a>) leads to the following Lagrangian:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E24"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{L}(\theta,\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\lambda)=\mathcal{R}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})+\lambda\left(\mathcal{D}(\theta,\phi)-\mathcal{D}_{0}\right)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{L}(\theta,\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\lambda)=\mathcal{R}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})+\lambda\left(\mathcal{D}(\theta,\phi)-\mathcal{D}_{0}\right),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(24)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.4" class="ltx_p">with the corresponding constrained optimisation problem defined in Eq. (<a href="#S3.E7" title="In 3.1 Learning the Initial Distribution ‣ 3 Constrained Optimisation Framework for Improved System Identification ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Integrating the Deep Kalman Filter and Smoother With the Constrained Optimisation Framework</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In order to integrate DKF/DKS <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">17</a>]</cite> with our proposed constrained optimisation framework, we specify the distortion and rate that define the ELBO.
This allows us to formulate the Lagrangian of the constrained optimisation problem defined in Eq. (<a href="#S3.E7" title="In 3.1 Learning the Initial Distribution ‣ 3 Constrained Optimisation Framework for Improved System Identification ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS3.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.3.1 </span>Original Evidence Lower Bound (Smoother Version)</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The objective function introduced by <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">Krishnan et al. [17]</a></cite> for training deep Kalman smoothers (DKSs) is</p>
<table id="A1.EGx22" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E25"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{F}_{\text{ELBO}}^{\text{DKS}}(\theta,\psi,\phi)=-\mathcal{D}_{\text{DKS}}(\theta,\phi)-\mathcal{R}_{\text{DKS}}(\psi,\phi)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mtext>ELBO</mtext><mtext>DKS</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>DKS</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>DKS</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{F}_{\text{ELBO}}^{\text{DKS}}(\theta,\psi,\phi)=-\mathcal{D}_{\text{DKS}}(\theta,\phi)-\mathcal{R}_{\text{DKS}}(\psi,\phi).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(25)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">The distortion is defined as</p>
<table id="A1.EGx23" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E26"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E26.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{D}_{\text{DKS}}(\theta,\phi)=-\sum_{t=1}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Big[\log p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})\Big]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>DKS</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{D}_{\text{DKS}}(\theta,\phi)=-\sum_{t=1}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Big[\log p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})\Big],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(26)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.3" class="ltx_p">and the rate is given by</p>
<table id="A1.EGx24" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex5"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{R}_{\text{DKS}}(\psi,\phi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>DKS</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{R}_{\text{DKS}}(\psi,\phi)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex5.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\|\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1})\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mo lspace="0.1389em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\|\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1})\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E27"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E27.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Big[\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})\|\,p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\big)\Big]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Big[\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})\|\,p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\big)\Big],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(27)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.4" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p(\mathbf{z}_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\mathbf{z}_{1})</annotation></semantics></math> is a standard normal distribution.
See <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">17</a>]</cite> for further implementation details.
Note that the filter version (DKF) is obtained by replacing <math id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.SS3.SSS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:t},\mathbf{u}_{1:t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:t},\mathbf{u}_{1:t})</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.3.2 </span>VHP-Based Evidence Lower Bound (Smoother Version)</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In the following, we integrate the VHP with DKS:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx25" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E28"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{F}_{\text{ELBO}}^{\text{VHP-DKS}}(\theta,\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=-\mathcal{D}_{\text{DKS}}(\theta,\phi)-\mathcal{R}_{\text{VHP-DKS}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mtext>ELBO</mtext><mtext>VHP-DKS</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>DKS</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>VHP-DKS</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{F}_{\text{ELBO}}^{\text{VHP-DKS}}(\theta,\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=-\mathcal{D}_{\text{DKS}}(\theta,\phi)-\mathcal{R}_{\text{VHP-DKS}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(28)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">The distortion remains identical to DKS (Eq. (<a href="#A1.E26" title="In A.3.1 Original Evidence Lower Bound (Smoother Version) ‣ A.3 Integrating the Deep Kalman Filter and Smoother With the Constrained Optimisation Framework ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">26</span></a>)).
By replacing the prior <math id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p(\mathbf{z}_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\mathbf{z}_{1})</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}_{\text{DKS}}(\psi,\phi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>DKS</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}_{\text{DKS}}(\psi,\phi)</annotation></semantics></math> with the VHP defined in Eq. (<a href="#S3.E6" title="In 3.1 Learning the Initial Distribution ‣ 3 Constrained Optimisation Framework for Improved System Identification ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>), we get:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx26" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{R}_{\text{VHP-DKS}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\bigg[\log q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})-\mathcal{F}_{\text{VHP}}(\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>VHP-DKS</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mtext>VHP</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.337em">;</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{R}_{\text{VHP-DKS}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\bigg[\log q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})-\mathcal{F}_{\text{VHP}}(\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E29"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E29.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 105.27519pt+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Big[\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})\|\,p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\big)\Big]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 105.27519pt+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Big[\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})\|\,p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\big)\Big].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(29)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">The filter version (VHP-DKF) is obtained, as with DKF, by replacing <math id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.SS3.SSS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:t},\mathbf{u}_{1:t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:t},\mathbf{u}_{1:t})</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.4 </span>Integrating the Deep Variational Bayes Filter and Smoother With the Constrained Optimisation Framework</h3>

<div id="A1.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In order to integrate DVBF/DVBS <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">13</a>]</cite> with our proposed constrained optimisation framework, we specify the distortion and rate that define the ELBO.
This allows us to formulate the Lagrangian of the constrained optimisation problem defined in Eq. (<a href="#S3.E7" title="In 3.1 Learning the Initial Distribution ‣ 3 Constrained Optimisation Framework for Improved System Identification ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS4.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.4.1 </span>Original Evidence Lower Bound (Smoother Version)</h4>

<div id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">DVBF was originally introduced in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">13</a>]</cite>.
In the following, we refer to the updated version presented in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">14</a>]</cite>.
The locally-linear transition model is described in Sec. <a href="#S4.SS1" title="4.1 Neural Linearisation of the Dynamic Model ‣ 4 Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a>.
The corresponding objective function for training deep variational Bayes smoothers (DVBSs) is</p>
<table id="A1.EGx27" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E30"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{F}_{\text{ELBO}}^{\text{DVBS}}(\theta,\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=-\mathcal{D}_{\text{DVBS}}(\theta,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})-\mathcal{R}_{\text{DVBS}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mtext>ELBO</mtext><mtext>DVBS</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>DVBS</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>DVBS</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{F}_{\text{ELBO}}^{\text{DVBS}}(\theta,\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=-\mathcal{D}_{\text{DVBS}}(\theta,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})-\mathcal{R}_{\text{DVBS}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(30)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">The distortion is defined as</p>
<table id="A1.EGx28" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{D}_{\text{DVBS}}(\theta,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=-\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p_{\mathcal{D}}(\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{2:T}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}),\mathbf{x}_{2:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Bigg[\log p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{1}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>DVBS</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>f</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{D}_{\text{DVBS}}(\theta,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=-\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p_{\mathcal{D}}(\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{2:T}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}),\mathbf{x}_{2:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Bigg[\log p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{1}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}))</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E31"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E31.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 91.04881pt\quad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\log p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})\Bigg]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 91.04881pt\quad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\log p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})\Bigg],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(31)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p1.3" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta})\mathrel{\widehat{=}}\mathbf{z}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mover accent="true"><mo>=</mo><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta})\mathrel{\widehat{=}}\mathbf{z}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> mimics an empirical Bayes prior that is learned from data, and the approximate posterior distribution factorises as</p>
<table id="A1.EGx29" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E32"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E32.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{2:T}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}),\mathbf{x}_{2:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})=q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{2}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}),\mathbf{x}_{2:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\,\prod_{t=3}^{T}q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{2:T}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}),\mathbf{x}_{2:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})=q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{2}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}),\mathbf{x}_{2:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\,\prod_{t=3}^{T}q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(32)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p1.4" class="ltx_p">Therefore, the rate is given by</p>
<table id="A1.EGx30" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex8"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{R}_{\text{DVBS}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{2:T}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}),\mathbf{x}_{2:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Bigg[\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\|\,p(\bm{\zeta})\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>DVBS</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>f</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{R}_{\text{DVBS}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{2:T}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}),\mathbf{x}_{2:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Bigg[\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\|\,p(\bm{\zeta})\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 92.47145pt+\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{2}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}),\mathbf{x}_{2:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\|\,p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{2}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}),\mathbf{u}_{1})\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 92.47145pt+\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{2}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}),\mathbf{x}_{2:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\|\,p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{2}|\,f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta}),\mathbf{u}_{1})\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E33"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E33.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 92.47145pt+\sum_{t=3}^{T}\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})\|\,p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\big)\Bigg]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 92.47145pt+\sum_{t=3}^{T}\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})\|\,p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\big)\Bigg],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(33)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p1.5" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p(\bm{\zeta})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\bm{\zeta})</annotation></semantics></math> is a standard normal distribution.
The conditional approximate posterior is implemented as the product of two distributions <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">14</a>]</cite>:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx31" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E34"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E34.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})\propto p_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\times q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t:T})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})\propto p_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\times q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t:T}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(34)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p1.6" class="ltx_p">Further implementation details can be found in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">13</a>]</cite> and <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">14</a>]</cite>.
Note that the filter version (DVBF) is obtained by replacing <math id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t:T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t:T})</annotation></semantics></math> in Eq. (<a href="#A1.E34" title="In A.4.1 Original Evidence Lower Bound (Smoother Version) ‣ A.4 Integrating the Deep Variational Bayes Filter and Smoother With the Constrained Optimisation Framework ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">34</span></a>) with <math id="A1.SS4.SSS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS4.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.4.2 </span>VHP-Based Evidence Lower Bound (Smoother Version)</h4>

<div id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In the following, we integrate the VHP with DVBS:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx32" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E35"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{F}_{\text{ELBO}}^{\text{VHP-DVBS}}(\theta,\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=-\mathcal{D}_{\text{VHP-DVBS}}(\theta,\phi)-\mathcal{R}_{\text{VHP-DVBS}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mtext>ELBO</mtext><mtext>VHP-DVBS</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>VHP-DVBS</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>VHP-DVBS</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{F}_{\text{ELBO}}^{\text{VHP-DVBS}}(\theta,\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=-\mathcal{D}_{\text{VHP-DVBS}}(\theta,\phi)-\mathcal{R}_{\text{VHP-DVBS}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(35)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">By replacing the deterministic transformation <math id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{\psi_{0}}(\bm{\zeta})</annotation></semantics></math> with the VHP defined in Eq. (<a href="#S3.E6" title="In 3.1 Learning the Initial Distribution ‣ 3 Constrained Optimisation Framework for Improved System Identification ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>), the marginal approximate posterior simplifies to <math id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t:T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t:T})</annotation></semantics></math> for all time steps <em id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">including the initial time step</em>.
As a result, the approximate posterior factorises as</p>
<table id="A1.EGx33" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E36"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E36.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})=q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\,\prod_{t=2}^{T}q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})=q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\,\prod_{t=2}^{T}q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(36)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Thus, the distortion is given by</p>
<table id="A1.EGx34" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E37"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E37.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{D}_{\text{VHP-DVBS}}(\theta,\phi)=-\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\left[\sum_{t=1}^{T}\log p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})\right]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>VHP-DVBS</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{D}_{\text{VHP-DVBS}}(\theta,\phi)=-\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\left[\sum_{t=1}^{T}\log p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(37)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.4" class="ltx_p">and the rate is defined as</p>
<table id="A1.EGx35" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{R}_{\text{VHP-DVBS}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Bigg[\log q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})-\mathcal{F}_{\text{VHP}}(\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\,\mathbf{z}_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mtext>VHP-DVBS</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mtext>VHP</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.337em">;</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{R}_{\text{VHP-DVBS}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\Bigg[\log q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})-\mathcal{F}_{\text{VHP}}(\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\,\mathbf{z}_{1})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E38"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E38.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 110.96574pt-\sum_{t=2}^{T}\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})\|\,p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\big)\Bigg]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 110.96574pt-\sum_{t=2}^{T}\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})\|\,p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\big)\Bigg].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(38)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.5" class="ltx_p">The conditional approximate posterior <math id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t-1:T})</annotation></semantics></math> is implemented as for DVBS (Eq. (<a href="#A1.E34" title="In A.4.1 Original Evidence Lower Bound (Smoother Version) ‣ A.4 Integrating the Deep Variational Bayes Filter and Smoother With the Constrained Optimisation Framework ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">34</span></a>)).
The filter version (VHP-DVBF) is obtained, as with DVBF, by replacing <math id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t:T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t:T},\mathbf{u}_{t:T})</annotation></semantics></math> in Eq. (<a href="#A1.E34" title="In A.4.1 Original Evidence Lower Bound (Smoother Version) ‣ A.4 Integrating the Deep Variational Bayes Filter and Smoother With the Constrained Optimisation Framework ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">34</span></a>) with <math id="A1.SS4.SSS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{\phi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.5 </span>Extended Kalman Filtering and Smoothing With a Neural Linearisation of the Dynamic Model Function</h3>

<div id="A1.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In the following, we provide an analysis of how Kalman filtering/smoothing is applied in combination with the locally-linear transition model defined in Eq. (<a href="#S4.E9" title="In 4.1 Neural Linearisation of the Dynamic Model ‣ 4 Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>) and the auxiliary-variable model defined in Eq. (<a href="#S4.E12" title="In 4.2 Linear Auxiliary-Variable Model ‣ 4 Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>).
To this end, we first consider the <em id="A1.SS5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">prediction step</em> that allows analytically computing</p>
<table id="A1.EGx36" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E39"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E39.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-1})=\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{m}_{t}^{-},\mathbf{P}_{t}^{-})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐦</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐏</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-1})=\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{m}_{t}^{-},\mathbf{P}_{t}^{-}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(39)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.2" class="ltx_p">given the filtered distribution</p>
<table id="A1.EGx37" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E40"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E40.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-1})=\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{P}_{t-1})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐏</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-1})=\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{P}_{t-1}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(40)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.3" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐦</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{m}</annotation></semantics></math> refers to the mean and <math id="A1.SS5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{P}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐏</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{P}</annotation></semantics></math> to the covariance of a Gaussian distribution.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS5.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The nonlinear dynamic model is typically defined as</p>
<table id="A1.EGx38" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E41"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{z}_{t}=\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})+\mathbf{q}_{t-1}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐟</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐪</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{z}_{t}=\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})+\mathbf{q}_{t-1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(41)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p2.2" class="ltx_p">In extended Kalman filtering/smoothing, the dynamic model function <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐟</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})</annotation></semantics></math> is locally linearised by means of a first-order Taylor expansion, which allows applying the Kalman filter/smoother algorithm as follows.
The prediction step is defined by:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx39" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E42"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{m}_{t}^{-}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐦</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{m}_{t}^{-}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E42.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝐟</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(42)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E43"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E43.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{F}_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐅</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{F}_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E43.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left.\frac{\partial\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})}{\partial\mathbf{z}}\right|_{\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>𝐟</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>𝐳</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left.\frac{\partial\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})}{\partial\mathbf{z}}\right|_{\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(43)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E44"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E44.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{P}_{t}^{-}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐏</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{P}_{t}^{-}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E44.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{F}_{t-1}\mathbf{P}_{t-1}\mathbf{F}_{t-1}^{\text{T}}+\mathbf{Q}_{t-1}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐅</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐏</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐅</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mtext>T</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{F}_{t-1}\mathbf{P}_{t-1}\mathbf{F}_{t-1}^{\text{T}}+\mathbf{Q}_{t-1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(44)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p2.3" class="ltx_p">In case of an unknown dynamic model function, we can approximate <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐟</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})</annotation></semantics></math> by a function that is locally linear w.r.t. discrete time steps.
This allows formulating the prediction step of the mean as</p>
<table id="A1.EGx40" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E45"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E45.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{m}_{t}^{-}=\left.\frac{\partial\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})}{\partial\mathbf{z}}\right|_{\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1}}\cdot\mathbf{m}_{t-1}+\left.\frac{\partial\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})}{\partial\mathbf{u}}\right|_{\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1}}\cdot\mathbf{u}_{t-1}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐦</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>𝐟</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>𝐳</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo rspace="0.055em">|</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>𝐟</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>𝐮</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo rspace="0.055em">|</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{m}_{t}^{-}=\left.\frac{\partial\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})}{\partial\mathbf{z}}\right|_{\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1}}\cdot\mathbf{m}_{t-1}+\left.\frac{\partial\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})}{\partial\mathbf{u}}\right|_{\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1}}\cdot\mathbf{u}_{t-1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(45)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p2.4" class="ltx_p">In our proposed transition model (Eq. (<a href="#S4.E9" title="In 4.1 Neural Linearisation of the Dynamic Model ‣ 4 Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>)), the above Jacobians are replaced by</p>
<table id="A1.EGx41" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E46"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E46.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left.\frac{\partial\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})}{\partial\mathbf{z}}\right|_{\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>𝐟</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>𝐳</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left.\frac{\partial\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})}{\partial\mathbf{z}}\right|_{\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E46.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\rightarrow\,\mathbf{F}_{\psi}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo rspace="0.448em" stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐅</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\rightarrow\,\mathbf{F}_{\psi}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(46)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E47"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E47.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left.\frac{\partial\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})}{\partial\mathbf{u}}\right|_{\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>𝐟</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><mi>𝐮</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left.\frac{\partial\mathbf{f}(\mathbf{z},\mathbf{u})}{\partial\mathbf{u}}\right|_{\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E47.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\rightarrow\,\mathbf{B}_{\psi}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo rspace="0.448em" stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐁</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\rightarrow\,\mathbf{B}_{\psi}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(47)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p2.5" class="ltx_p">Eq. (<a href="#A1.E46" title="In A.5 Extended Kalman Filtering and Smoothing With a Neural Linearisation of the Dynamic Model Function ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">46</span></a>) and (<a href="#A1.E47" title="In A.5 Extended Kalman Filtering and Smoothing With a Neural Linearisation of the Dynamic Model Function ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">47</span></a>) allow defining the prediction step as</p>
<table id="A1.EGx42" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E48"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E48.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{m}_{t}^{-}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐦</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{m}_{t}^{-}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E48.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{F}_{\psi}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\cdot\mathbf{m}_{t-1}+\mathbf{B}_{\psi}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\cdot\mathbf{u}_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐅</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐁</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{F}_{\psi}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\cdot\mathbf{m}_{t-1}+\mathbf{B}_{\psi}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\cdot\mathbf{u}_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(48)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E49"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E49.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{F}_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐅</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{F}_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E49.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{F}_{\psi}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐅</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{F}_{\psi}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(49)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E50"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E50.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{Q}_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{Q}_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E50.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{Q}_{\psi}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐦</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{Q}_{\psi}(\mathbf{m}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(50)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E51"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E51.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{P}_{t}^{-}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐏</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{P}_{t}^{-}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E51.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{F}_{t-1}\mathbf{P}_{t-1}\mathbf{F}_{t-1}^{\text{T}}+\mathbf{Q}_{t-1}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐅</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐏</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐅</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mtext>T</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>𝐐</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{F}_{t-1}\mathbf{P}_{t-1}\mathbf{F}_{t-1}^{\text{T}}+\mathbf{Q}_{t-1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(51)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS5.p2.6" class="ltx_p">The <em id="A1.SS5.p2.6.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">update step</em> corresponds to the classic Kalman filter/smoother due to the linear Gaussian <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\psi}(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\psi}(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> (Eq. (<a href="#S4.E12" title="In 4.2 Linear Auxiliary-Variable Model ‣ 4 Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>)).
The <em id="A1.SS5.p2.6.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">backward recursion</em> is defined by <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{m}_{t}^{-}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐦</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{m}_{t}^{-}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{F}_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐅</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{F}_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A1.SS5.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{P}_{t}^{-}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐏</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{P}_{t}^{-}</annotation></semantics></math> in Eqs. (<a href="#A1.E48" title="In A.5 Extended Kalman Filtering and Smoothing With a Neural Linearisation of the Dynamic Model Function ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">48</span></a>, <a href="#A1.E49" title="In A.5 Extended Kalman Filtering and Smoothing With a Neural Linearisation of the Dynamic Model Function ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">49</span></a>, <a href="#A1.E51" title="In A.5 Extended Kalman Filtering and Smoothing With a Neural Linearisation of the Dynamic Model Function ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">51</span></a>).
Therefore, it is identical to the Kalman smoother.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.6 </span>Derivation of the Extended Kalman VAE</h3>

<div id="A1.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In the following, we derive <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}_{\text{ELBO}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mtext>ELBO</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}_{\text{ELBO}}</annotation></semantics></math> of the EKVAE, i.e. the distortion <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}(\theta,\phi)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}(\theta,\phi)</annotation></semantics></math> and rate <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{R}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{R}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0})</annotation></semantics></math> in Eq. (<a href="#S4.E15" title="In 4.3 Integration With the CO Framework: Deriving Distortion and Rate ‣ 4 Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>) and (<a href="#S4.Ex3" title="In 4.3 Integration With the CO Framework: Deriving Distortion and Rate ‣ 4 Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>).
To this end, we start with the generative model that defines <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{u}_{1:T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{u}_{1:T})</annotation></semantics></math>.
Note that the graphical model can be found in App. <a href="#A1.SS6.SSS4" title="A.6.4 Graphical Model ‣ A.6 Derivation of the Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.6.4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS6.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.6.1 </span>Generative Model</h4>

<div id="A1.SS6.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS6.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In addition to the latent variables <math id="A1.SS6.SSS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{z}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{z}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, we use the auxiliary variables <math id="A1.SS6.SSS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{a}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{a}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> to facilitate extended Kalman filtering/smoothing and <math id="A1.SS6.SSS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\zeta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝜻</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\zeta}</annotation></semantics></math> to model the empirical Bayes prior:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx43" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{u}_{1:T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{u}_{1:T})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E52"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E52.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad=\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{z}_{1:T},\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{a}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝜻</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad=\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{z}_{1:T},\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{a}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(52)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E53"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E53.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad=\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\cancel{\mathbf{z}_{1:T}},\cancel{\bm{\zeta}},\cancel{\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1}})\,p(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1:T},\cancel{\bm{\zeta}},\cancel{\mathbf{u}_{1:T}})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\bm{\zeta},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\,p(\bm{\zeta})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{a}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><menclose notation="updiagonalstrike"><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></menclose><mo>,</mo><menclose notation="updiagonalstrike"><mi>𝜻</mi></menclose><mo>,</mo><menclose notation="updiagonalstrike"><mrow><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></menclose><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><menclose notation="updiagonalstrike"><mi>𝜻</mi></menclose><mo>,</mo><menclose notation="updiagonalstrike"><mrow><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></menclose><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝜻</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad=\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\cancel{\mathbf{z}_{1:T}},\cancel{\bm{\zeta}},\cancel{\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1}})\,p(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1:T},\cancel{\bm{\zeta}},\cancel{\mathbf{u}_{1:T}})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\bm{\zeta},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\,p(\bm{\zeta})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{a}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(53)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E54"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E54.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad=\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T})\,p(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1:T})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\bm{\zeta},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\,p(\bm{\zeta})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{a}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝜻</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad=\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T})\,p(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1:T})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1:T}|\,\bm{\zeta},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})\,p(\bm{\zeta})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{a}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(54)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E55"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E55.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad=\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!\prod_{t=1}^{T}\Big(p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{t})\,p_{\psi}(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})\Big)\,\prod_{t=2}^{T}\Big(p(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\Big)\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\,p(\bm{\zeta})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{a}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.170em">)</mo></mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.170em">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝜻</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad=\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!\prod_{t=1}^{T}\Big(p_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{t})\,p_{\psi}(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})\Big)\,\prod_{t=2}^{T}\Big(p(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\Big)\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\,p(\bm{\zeta})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{a}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(55)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS6.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.6.2 </span>Evidence Lower Bound (Smoother Version)</h4>

<div id="A1.SS6.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS6.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Starting from Eq. (<a href="#A1.E55" title="In A.6.1 Generative Model ‣ A.6 Derivation of the Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">55</span></a>), in a first step, we marginalise <math id="A1.SS6.SSS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbf{a}_{1:T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{a}_{1:T}</annotation></semantics></math> via Monte Carlo integration based on <math id="A1.SS6.SSS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="q_{\phi}(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{\phi}(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})</annotation></semantics></math>.
Furthermore, we use a chain factorisation based on Bayes’ theorem to split the integral w.r.t. <math id="A1.SS6.SSS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbf{z}_{1:T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{z}_{1:T}</annotation></semantics></math> into double integrals:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx44" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\log p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{u}_{1:T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\log p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{u}_{1:T})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\geq\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}}\bigg[\log\frac{p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T})}{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\geq\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}}\bigg[\log\frac{p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T})}{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E56"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E56.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad+\log\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\prod_{t=2}^{T}\Big(p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\Big)\,p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\,p(\bm{\zeta})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}\bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.170em">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝜻</mi><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad+\log\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\prod_{t=2}^{T}\Big(p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\Big)\,p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\,p(\bm{\zeta})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1:T}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}\bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(56)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}}\bigg[\log\frac{p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T})}{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}+\log\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\,p(\bm{\zeta})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝜻</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}}\bigg[\log\frac{p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T})}{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}+\log\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\,p(\bm{\zeta})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E57"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E57.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\log\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!\underbrace{p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})}_{\text{observation}}\,\overbrace{p(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})}^{\text{transition}}\,\underbrace{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-2})}_{\text{filtered distribution}}\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{t}\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{t-1}\bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>observation</mtext></munder><mover><mover accent="true"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏞</mo></mover><mtext>transition</mtext></mover><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>filtered distribution</mtext></munder><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\log\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!\underbrace{p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})}_{\text{observation}}\,\overbrace{p(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})}^{\text{transition}}\,\underbrace{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-2})}_{\text{filtered distribution}}\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{t}\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{t-1}\bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(57)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex15.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}}\bigg[\log\frac{p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T})}{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}+\log\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\,p(\bm{\zeta})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>d</mi><mi>𝜻</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad=\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}}\bigg[\log\frac{p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T})}{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}+\log\int\hskip-5.69054pt\int\!p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\,p(\bm{\zeta})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{1}\,\mathrm{d}\bm{\zeta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E58"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E58.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\log\int\overbrace{p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})}^{\int\!p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{t}}\,p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-2})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{t-1}\bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><mover><mover accent="true"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏞</mo></mover><mstyle scriptlevel="-1"><mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" rspace="0.047em" stretchy="true">∫</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.700em">p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝐚</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝐳</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.700em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝐳</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝐳</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.710em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.710em">1</mn></mrow></msub><mo mathsize="0.700em">,</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝐮</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.710em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.710em">1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.700em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝐳</mi><mi mathsize="0.710em">t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mover><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\log\int\overbrace{p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})}^{\int\!p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t})\,p(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{t}}\,p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-2})\,\mathrm{d}\mathbf{z}_{t-1}\bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(58)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS6.SSS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS6.SSS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">As discussed in Sec. <a href="#S4.SS3" title="4.3 Integration With the CO Framework: Deriving Distortion and Rate ‣ 4 Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a>, we solve the integral in Eq. (<a href="#A1.Ex15" title="In A.6.2 Evidence Lower Bound (Smoother Version) ‣ A.6 Derivation of the Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">58</span></a>) only w.r.t. <math id="A1.SS6.SSS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{z}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{z}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> in closed form and marginalise <math id="A1.SS6.SSS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{z}_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{z}_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math> in Eq. (<a href="#A1.Ex16" title="In A.6.2 Evidence Lower Bound (Smoother Version) ‣ A.6 Derivation of the Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">59</span></a>) via Monte Carlo integration based on the smoothed distributions <math id="A1.SS6.SSS2.p2.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})</annotation></semantics></math>.
Furthermore, we marginalise <math id="A1.SS6.SSS2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\zeta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝜻</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\zeta}</annotation></semantics></math> via Monte Carlo integration by using <math id="A1.SS6.SSS2.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}_{\text{VHP}}(\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\,\mathbf{z}_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mtext>VHP</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}_{\text{VHP}}(\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\,\mathbf{z}_{1})</annotation></semantics></math> defined in Eq. (<a href="#S3.E6" title="In 3.1 Learning the Initial Distribution ‣ 3 Constrained Optimisation Framework for Improved System Identification ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>):</p>
<table id="A1.EGx45" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex16.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle(\ref{app:seq-vhp-ekvae_elbo_bfs})\geq\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}}\Bigg[\log\frac{p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T})}{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic"><a href="#A1.Ex15" title="In A.6.2 Evidence Lower Bound (Smoother Version) ‣ A.6 Derivation of the Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref ltx_font_italic"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">58</span></a></mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(\ref{app:seq-vhp-ekvae_elbo_bfs})\geq\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}}\Bigg[\log\frac{p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T})}{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad+\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}}\bigg[\log p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})-\log p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})+\overbrace{\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\left[\log\frac{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\,p(\bm{\zeta})}{q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}\right]}^{\mathcal{F}_{\text{VHP}}(\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\,\mathbf{z}_{1})~\text{in Eq.~(\ref{eq:seq-vhp-ekvae_rate_init})}}\bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mover><mover accent="true"><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏞</mo></mover><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mtext>VHP</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.270em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mtext>in Eq. (</mtext><mtext><a href="#S4.E18" title="In 4.3 Integration With the CO Framework: Deriving Distortion and Rate ‣ 4 Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a></mtext><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mover><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad+\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}}\bigg[\log p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})-\log p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})+\overbrace{\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\left[\log\frac{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\,p(\bm{\zeta})}{q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}\right]}^{\mathcal{F}_{\text{VHP}}(\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\,\mathbf{z}_{1})~\text{in Eq.~(\ref{eq:seq-vhp-ekvae_rate_init})}}\bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E59"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E59.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}}\bigg[\log p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})+\log\frac{\overbrace{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-2})}^{\text{filtered distribution}}}{\underbrace{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}_{\text{smoothed distribution}}}\bigg]\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mover accent="true"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏞</mo></mover><msup><mrow></mrow><mtext>filtered distribution</mtext></msup></mrow><mrow><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>smoothed distribution</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}}\bigg[\log p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})+\log\frac{\overbrace{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-2})}^{\text{filtered distribution}}}{\underbrace{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}_{\text{smoothed distribution}}}\bigg]\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(59)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad=\underbrace{\sum_{t=1}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})}}\Big[\log p(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{t})\Big]}_{-\mathcal{D}(\theta,\phi)~\text{in Eq.~(\ref{eq:seq-vhp-ekvae_dist})}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="1.278em">=</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.270em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mtext>in Eq. (</mtext><mtext><a href="#S4.E15" title="In 4.3 Integration With the CO Framework: Deriving Distortion and Rate ‣ 4 Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a></mtext><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad=\underbrace{\sum_{t=1}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})}}\Big[\log p(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{t})\Big]}_{-\mathcal{D}(\theta,\phi)~\text{in Eq.~(\ref{eq:seq-vhp-ekvae_dist})}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex19.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad-\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}}\Bigg[\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}}\underbrace{\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\bigg[\log\frac{q(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1})}{p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}+\log\frac{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})}+\log\frac{q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}{p(\bm{\zeta})}\bigg]}_{\mathcal{R}_{\text{initial}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{z}_{1})~\text{in Eq.~(\ref{eq:seq-vhp-ekvae_rate})}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>initial</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>ψ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ψ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.337em">;</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.270em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mrow><mtext>in Eq. (</mtext><mtext><a href="#S4.Ex3" title="In 4.3 Integration With the CO Framework: Deriving Distortion and Rate ‣ 4 Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a></mtext><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></munder></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad-\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}}\Bigg[\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}}\underbrace{\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\bigg[\log\frac{q(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1})}{p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}+\log\frac{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})}+\log\frac{q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}{p(\bm{\zeta})}\bigg]}_{\mathcal{R}_{\text{initial}}(\psi,\phi,\psi_{0},\phi_{0};\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{z}_{1})~\text{in Eq.~(\ref{eq:seq-vhp-ekvae_rate})}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E60"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E60.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad\quad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}}\bigg[\log\frac{q(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})}{p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})}+\log\frac{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-2})}\bigg]\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad\quad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}}\bigg[\log\frac{q(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})}{p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})}+\log\frac{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})}{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-2})}\bigg]\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(60)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex20.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\approx\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{z}_{1:T},\mathbf{a}_{1:T}\sim q(\mathbf{z}_{1:T},\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{\bm{\zeta}\sim q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\Bigg[\sum_{t=1}^{T}\log p(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>𝜻</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\approx\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{z}_{1:T},\mathbf{a}_{1:T}\sim q(\mathbf{z}_{1:T},\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{\bm{\zeta}\sim q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\Bigg[\sum_{t=1}^{T}\log p(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex21"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex21.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad-\Big(\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1})\|\,p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\big)+\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})\|\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\big)+\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\|\,p(\bm{\zeta})\big)\Big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad-\Big(\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1})\|\,p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\big)+\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})\|\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\big)+\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\|\,p(\bm{\zeta})\big)\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E61"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E61.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad-\sum_{t=2}^{T}\Big(\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})\|\,p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\big)+\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})\|\,p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-2})\big)\Big)\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad-\sum_{t=2}^{T}\Big(\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})\|\,p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})\big)+\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})\|\,p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-2})\big)\Big)\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(61)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex22"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\eqqcolon\mathcal{F}_{\text{ELBO}}^{\text{~EKVAE (smoother version)}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="1.278em">≕</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mtext>ELBO</mtext><mtext> EKVAE (smoother version)</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\eqqcolon\mathcal{F}_{\text{ELBO}}^{\text{~EKVAE (smoother version)}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS6.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.6.3 </span>Evidence Lower Bound (Filter Version)</h4>

<div id="A1.SS6.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS6.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The filter version of the EKVAE corresponds to the smoother version with the difference of replacing <math id="A1.SS6.SSS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T-1})</annotation></semantics></math> by <math id="A1.SS6.SSS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>ψ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\psi}(\mathbf{z}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-1})</annotation></semantics></math>.
In contrast to a closed-form evaluation, this enables a sample-based optimisation of the transition parameters <math id="A1.SS6.SSS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\psi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ψ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi</annotation></semantics></math>, as discussed in Sec. <a href="#S4.SS3" title="4.3 Integration With the CO Framework: Deriving Distortion and Rate ‣ 4 Extended Kalman VAE ‣ Latent Matters: Learning Deep State-Space Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.3</span></a>.
As a result, we obtain:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx46" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex23"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex23.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\log p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{u}_{1:T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\log p(\mathbf{x}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{u}_{1:T})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex24"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\geq\sum_{t=1}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})}}\Big[\log p(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{t})\Big]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="1.278em">≥</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\geq\sum_{t=1}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})}}\Big[\log p(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{t})\Big]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex25"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex25.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad-\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}}\Bigg[\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\bigg[\log\frac{q(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1})}{p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}+\log\frac{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1})}{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})}+\log\frac{q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}{p(\bm{\zeta})}\bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad-\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T})}}\Bigg[\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\bigg[\log\frac{q(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1})}{p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}+\log\frac{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1})}{p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})}+\log\frac{q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}{p(\bm{\zeta})}\bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E62"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E62.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad\quad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-2})}}\bigg[\log\frac{q(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})}{p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})}\bigg]\Bigg]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">]</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad\quad+\sum_{t=2}^{T}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{p(\mathbf{z}_{t-1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1:t-1},\mathbf{u}_{1:t-2})}}\bigg[\log\frac{q(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{x}_{t})}{p(\mathbf{a}_{t}|\,\mathbf{z}_{t-1},\mathbf{u}_{t-1})}\bigg]\Bigg]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(62)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex26"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex26.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\quad\approx\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{z}_{1:T},\mathbf{a}_{1:T}\sim q(\mathbf{z}_{1:T},\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{\bm{\zeta}\sim q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\Bigg[\sum_{t=1}^{T}\log p(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐚</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐮</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mi>𝜻</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.170em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mo maxsize="2.600em" minsize="2.600em">[</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad\approx\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{z}_{1:T},\mathbf{a}_{1:T}\sim q(\mathbf{z}_{1:T},\mathbf{a}_{1:T}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1:T},\mathbf{u}_{1:T})}}\mathop{\mathbb{E}_{\bm{\zeta}\sim q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})}}\Bigg[\sum_{t=1}^{T}\log p(\mathbf{x}_{t}|\,\mathbf{a}_{t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex27"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex27.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\qquad-\Big(\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{x}_{1})\|\,p(\mathbf{a}_{1}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\big)+\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\mathbf{a}_{1})\|\,p(\mathbf{z}_{1}|\,\bm{\zeta})\big)+\mathop{\mathrm{KL}}\big(q(\bm{\zeta}|\,\mathbf{z}_{1})\|\,p(\bm{\zeta})\big)\Big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐚</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.337em">∥</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">KL</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝜻</mi><mo fence="false" rspace="0.337em" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo str